1
00:00:00,394 --> 00:00:02,464
(Raj:)Hey.

2
00:00:02,462 --> 00:00:04,192
(Amy:)Hey, what's going on?
Not much.

3
00:00:04,197 --> 00:00:05,627
(Bernadette:)You want to get a drink later?

4
00:00:05,632 --> 00:00:06,832
(Bernadette:)Just the two of us?

5
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:07,833
(Amy:)No Penny?

6
00:00:07,834 --> 00:00:08,934
(Bernadette:)Not tonight.

7
00:00:08,936 --> 00:00:10,206
(Bernadette:)I'm a little frustrated
with her.

8
00:00:10,203 --> 00:00:12,073
(Amy:)Because you got her the job
and you think

9
00:00:12,072 --> 00:00:13,902
(Amy:)she should be working harder
to prepare for it?

10
00:00:13,907 --> 00:00:17,447
(Bernadette:)So it's not just me.
You see it, too!

11
00:00:19,012 --> 00:00:21,982
(Amy:)I do, I see it.

12
00:00:21,982 --> 00:00:23,752
(Bernadette:)It's driving me crazy.

13
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,580
(Bernadette:)Just this afternoon,
I saw on Instagram

14
00:00:25,585 --> 00:00:27,955
(Bernadette:)that instead of studying,
she went out to lunch

15
00:00:27,955 --> 00:00:29,555
(Bernadette:)and got a manicure.

16
00:00:30,524 --> 00:00:33,194
That's outrageous!

17
00:00:33,193 --> 00:00:34,363
I know!

18
00:00:34,361 --> 00:00:35,791
(Amy:)If she doesn't do well,

19
00:00:35,796 --> 00:00:38,396
th-this could reflect poorly
on you.

20
00:00:38,398 --> 00:00:41,738
(Bernadette:)Exactly. Does she not realize it
or does she not care?

21
00:00:41,735 --> 00:00:43,035
(Leonard:)I don't know.

22
00:00:43,036 --> 00:00:45,436
(Amy:)The important thing is
I am here for you

23
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:49,439
(Amy:)so we can mutually disparage
this unpleasing third party.

24
00:00:54,848 --> 00:00:57,578
(Leonard:)Hey. We just wanted to see

25
00:00:57,584 --> 00:00:59,254
(Leonard:)how your class was going.
Where is everybody?

26
00:00:59,252 --> 00:01:01,752
(Sheldon:)There is no class.

